        "chars_per_1k_ink": 6.18
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        226,
        1976,
        1931,
        2305
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In your Department there undoubtedly are many employees who may be interested in taking a child. I urge you to assist the Department of Welfare by distributing the attached literature to each of your staff members, and by permitting the display of posters and other illustrative material, as well as in any other way possible. Additional material will be sent to you by the Department of Welfare at your request.",
